---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Dharmic Data | A school for a future we share</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A good teacher can change a life. A great teacher can change a civilization. Jai Bhagat is building Dharmic Data through Conscious Compute, paid learning and work our communities can use." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="A school for a future we share | Dharmic Data" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Great teachers. Human imagination. AI in service of a future people have a stake in." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://dharmicdata.org/dharmic-assets/jai-portrait-motion.jpg" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/school.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header shell">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Dharmic Data home"><span aria-hidden="true" class="brand-mark">✳</span> Dharmic Data</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#school">The school</a><a href="#story">Jai's story</a><a href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">The library ↗</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#learn">Learn with Jai <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-top"><span class="eyebrow">A school in the making</span><span class="edition">Conscious Compute / 001</span></div>
      <p class="good-teacher">A good teacher can change the course of someone's life.</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">A great teacher can change the course of <em>an entire civilization.</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-bottom">
        <p>I'm Jai. I want to pay a generation to become builders, owners and stewards of their communities' AI future. Dharmic Data is the school I'm building to make that possible.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#learn">Start learning with me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#school">Help imagine the school <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-foot"><span>A belief to put into practice.</span><span>People first. Imagination always.</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="lineage" aria-labelledby="lineage-title">
      <div class="shell lineage-grid">
        <div class="book-scene" aria-label="Illustrated covers of Homer's Iliad and Odyssey">
          <div class="book book-iliad"><span>HOMER</span><strong>THE<br />ILIAD</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><small>A story carried forward</small></div>
          <div class="book book-odyssey"><span>HOMER</span><strong>THE<br />ODYSSEY</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i><small>A journey shared</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lineage-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The long view</p>
          <h2 id="lineage-title">What we teach outlives us.</h2>
          <p>Homer's epics became part of how ancient Greeks learned and argued about what a good life required. Generations of performers, teachers and readers carried those stories forward.</p>
          <p>I return to that history because teaching helps people decide what is worth doing with their abilities. AI makes that question more urgent, and our imagination gives us somewhere to begin.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">Explore the Civilizational Shelf <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="source-note">My tribute to Jiang Xueqin's Predictive History. <a href="https://classics.mit.edu/Plato/republic.11.x.html">Read the ancient debate about Homer's influence.</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="story" class="founder shell" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The person making this bet</p>
          <h2 id="founder-title">I won an NVIDIA hackathon <em>with friends.</em></h2>
          <p class="section-lead">We imagined a call from your future self. A small act of care, made possible by people who knew how to build it.</p>
          <p>At the New York hackathon hosted by NVIDIA, MongoDB and Dell, I joined former Cityblock coworkers to imagine a supportive, clinic-controlled check-in. We called our team American Exceptionalism. The Dell Pro Max with GB10 we won expanded what I could build with my MacBooks.</p>
          <p>I had been mentoring and teaching since 2022. The win gave that work more room. Now I'm using the same practice to imagine a school with other people, then work through the skills and decisions it takes to make it real.</p>
          <p class="personal-note">For me, love means taking someone's imagination seriously enough to spend time with it. I bring my Gujarati and Dharmic background. You bring yourself.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="founder-portrait"><img src="/dharmic-assets/jai-portrait-motion.jpg" alt="Jai Bhagat, from his Dogged Pursuits conversation" width="2025" height="3600" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Jai Bhagat. Educator, engineer and the person at the whiteboard.</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
      <div id="film" class="film-block">
        <div class="film-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">One expression of the idea</p><h3>A minute about the future we're imagining.</h3></div><span class="film-duration">60 seconds</span></div>
        {film.url ? <video class="founder-film" controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/dharmic-assets/founder-film-poster.svg" aria-label="Conscious Compute founder film, working cut" aria-describedby="film-status"><source src={film.url} type="video/mp4" /><track kind="captions" src="/dharmic-assets/founder-film-en.vtt" srclang="en" label="English draft captions" default />Your browser cannot play this video. Read the story below.</video> : <div class="film-poster"><img src="/dharmic-assets/founder-film-poster.svg" alt="Conscious Compute. A future we have a stake in. A 60-second film in progress." width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" /><span class="film-pending">The film is being prepared for public viewing.</span></div>}
        <p id="film-status" class="source-note">{film.review ? 'Private review copy. This working cut is not creatively approved. The film-production goal remains paused.' : 'A film in progress. The school is the larger work.'}</p>
        <div class="film-context">
          <article><span class="eyebrow">The concept</span><p>America can build extraordinary AI and still fail to build a future its people have a stake in. The school is my response.</p></article>
          <article><span class="eyebrow">The inspiration</span><p>A caring idea made with friends, years of teaching, and the stories people have used to imagine a life worth living.</p></article>
          <article><span class="eyebrow">The significance</span><p>Making the film exposed the same problem we want to teach: AI can produce something faster than we learn to judge it.</p></article>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href="#field-notes">Go behind the scenes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <details class="film-transcript"><summary>Read the film's narration and visual context</summary><p class="source-note">Draft text alternative from the current narration script and edit record. It does not replace the independent sound and picture review.</p><div id="film-transcript-body"><p>Our idea was a call from your future self, helping you keep going. That&#x27;s what I love about teaching and building: imagination becoming useful to someone.</p><p>The prize gave me tools to keep building. America can build extraordinary AI and still fail to build a future its people have a stake in.</p><p>I&#x27;m building Dharmic Data. A school where people get paid to learn by building for their communities. Time to learn. Teachers beside you.</p><p>My bet is that a generation can become builders, owners and stewards of our AI future.</p><p class="source-note">Visual context: historical printing, Jai’s own imagery, a generated future-self call concept, an illustrative community classroom, the literature project and a NASA view of America at night. These images do not document an operating paid cohort or a clinical outcome.</p></div></details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="school" class="school-section" aria-labelledby="school-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <span id="mission" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="school-head"><p class="eyebrow">Dharmic Data / The emerging school</p><h2 id="school-title">A future people have<br />a stake in.</h2><p class="section-lead">Conscious Compute is our signature workshop series. Bring an idea, work with people who can help, and learn to carry it forward.</p></div>
        <div class="experience-grid">
          <article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Imagine with someone.</h3><p>A learner, mentor and community host choose something worth making. Your questions help shape the work.</p><span class="role-note">A purpose you share</span></article>
          <article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Make it. Question it.</h3><p>Build with available AI. Explain your choices, try the result with its intended user, and make time for feedback.</p><span class="role-note">Judgment you practice</span></article>
          <article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Help someone continue.</h3><p>Return to a fresh problem. Give the host what they need to maintain the work. Help another teacher lead the experience.</p><span class="role-note">Capability you pass on</span></article>
        </div>
        <p class="school-belief">American Exceptionalism, to me, means taking responsibility for improving the institutions we depend on, through imagination and cooperation. Then sharing the means for others to contribute.</p>
        <div class="participation"><div><h3>Start learning now.</h3><p>Online workshops and cohorts. In-person workshops with community organizations every two weeks as hosts and funding come together.</p></div><div><h3>Make paid learning possible.</h3><p>Funded learner places are paid. Premium attendees pay separately. Network facilitators can help us repeat the experience through licensed curriculum.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pilot-bar"><span class="pilot-status">Seeking support</span><p><strong>Three pilots. Then a larger school.</strong> We are seeking $100,000 for the first test, with a desired larger launch in June 2027. Dates depend on funding and host readiness.</p><a href="mailto:jai@aplusactive.com?subject=Helping%20build%20Dharmic%20Data">Help shape the school <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="proof" class="proof-section shell" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
      <span id="projects" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The work behind the belief</p><h2 id="proof-title">Teaching already<br />changed something.</h2></div><p>These are people's accounts of learning with me through QEDC. They give the school a starting point. The proposed paid cohorts are the next test.</p></div>
      <div class="featured-reviews">{testimonials.slice(0,3).map(item => <a class="dharmic-testimonial-card" href={item.video}><img src={item.image} alt={item.name} width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" /><div><span class="review-play" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>{item.name}</h3><span>{item.role}</span><p>{item.result}</p><span class="text-link">Watch their account</span></div></a>)}</div>
      <details class="evidence-archive"><summary>More learner accounts and published work <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="more-reviews">{testimonials.slice(3).map(item => <a class="dharmic-testimonial-card compact-review" href={item.video}><img src={item.image} alt={item.name} width="90" height="90" loading="lazy" /><div><h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.result}</p></div></a>)}</div><div class="case-links">{cases.map(item => <a class="dharmic-case-card" href={item.href}><span>{item.name}'s case study</span><strong>{item.title}</strong><span>Read the reported outcome ↗</span></a>)}</div><a class="text-link" href="/vlog">Explore the build stories ↗</a></details>
    </section>

    <LearnWithJai />
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer shell"><a class="wordmark" href="/">✳ Dharmic Data</a><p>A school imagined with love.<br />Built through the work of learning.</p><div><a href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">Civilizational Shelf ↗</a><a href="/vlog">Build stories</a><a href="/shop">Culture & objects</a><a href="mailto:jai@aplusactive.com">Say hello</a></div><span class="footer-note">Dharmic Data is an emerging school. Programs and funded places are being developed.</span></footer>
</body>
</html>
